<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - March 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - March 3.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>PICA (M) Corporation Berhad became a substantial shareholder in Transcom International Limited on 09/03/1995 with a relevant interest in the issued ordinary share capital of 13,700,000 ordinary shares (5.99%).</p>
</text>
